/-- The pre-cell `J = anc_{b-2K}(I)` of a leaf cell `I` (blueprint line 1975). -/
noncomputable def preCell (I : ℤ × ℤ) : ℤ × ℤ := ancAt A.G I (D.blockOf I.1 - 2 * D.S.K)

